---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /notes/index.html
title: Notes
description: Write-ups and videos by Jason Yin — algorithm explainers and notes on things worth writing down.
last_updated: 2026-10-20
---
<h1>Notes</h1>
<p class="page-status"><span class="card-status">In progress</span></p>
<p class="section-intro">
  Short write-ups and videos — algorithm explainers, and notes on problems worth writing down.
</p>

{% if notes and notes.length %}
  <ul class="note-list">
    {% for n in notes | newestFirst %}
      <li class="note-item">
        <h2 class="note-title">
          {% if n.url %}<a href="{{ n.url | url }}">{{ n.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ n.title }}{% endif %}
        </h2>
        <p class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-date">{{ n.date }}</span>
          {% if n.kind %}<span class="card-status">{{ n.kind }}</span>{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p>{{ n.summary }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <div class="empty-state">
    <p><strong>Nothing published here yet.</strong></p>
    <p>
      This section is set up and waiting on its first entry. The plan is algorithm explainers to
      begin with — the kind of thing where writing it down is the point, and a short video does
      more than a paragraph.
    </p>
    <p>In the meantime, the <a href="{{ '/Projects/' | url }}">projects</a> have the write-ups.</p>
  </div>
{% endif %}

<!-- Adding the first entry also puts the Notes tab back in the nav.

     For a video, one entry in src/_data/notes.json is all it takes - the url
     can point straight at YouTube, external links pass through untouched:

       {
         "title":   "5 Levels of Difference Array",
         "date":    "October 2026",
         "sort":    "2026-10",
         "kind":    "Video",
         "summary": "One sentence on what the video covers.",
         "url":     "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..."
       }

     For a written note instead, set "kind": "Write-up" and
     "url": "/notes/my-note.html", then create src/notes/my-note.md with
     `permalink: /notes/my-note.html`. -->
